                <p class="card-link-copy">No. Workers use WhatsApp, which is already on their phone. They answer each question by text, voice note or photo. There is nothing to download and no per-user fee, so even a one-day subcontractor needs no onboarding.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card-link">
                <h3 class="card-link-title">What does a finished check produce?</h3>
                <p class="card-link-copy">A clean, structured digital record on a manager dashboard, with red, amber or green status on every item and photos attached. The record is live and searchable, and you can export a PDF whenever a document is needed.</p>
            </article>
